{"id": "EUVD-2026-102996", "enisaUuid": "768c3e1f-6c9d-366e-a3d3-5b71e284d5c8", "description": "LangChat through commit 2a6285a contains a missing authentication vulnerability that allows unauthenticated remote attackers to access REST controllers because no Sa-Token interceptor is registered. Attackers can query /api/v1/auth/users to read plaintext passwords, retrieve LLM provider API keys, create super-admin accounts, and modify or delete data.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T21:18:21", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/langchat-missing-global-auth-credential-exposure", "https://github.com/LangChat/langchat/blob/2a6285a6b8c51d51cdc599771bb667a30bc03f5c/langchat-server/src/main/java/cn/langchat/server/config/WebAsyncConfig.java#L17-L33", "https://github.com/LangChat/langchat/blob/2a6285a6b8c51d51cdc599771bb667a30bc03f5c/langchat-auth/src/main/java/cn/langchat/auth/controller/AigcUserController.java#L25-L60", "https://github.com/LangChat/langchat/blob/2a6285a6b8c51d51cdc599771bb667a30bc03f5c/langchat-auth/src/main/java/cn/langchat/auth/service/impl/AuthServiceImpl.java#L51-L58", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/langchat-through-commit-2a6285a-missing-authentication-on-rest-api-controllers"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111704", "GHSA-hgqj-chvw-c4p5"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.51, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d66608ba-3d30-3566-ac27-e7977d725eb9", "product": {"name": "langchat", "vendor": {"name": "LangChat"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642a6285a6b8c51d51cdc599771bb667a30bc03f5c"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fcc4af6f-abd1-3559-a6b1-0865b55b13bb", "vendor": {"name": "LangChat"}}], "isExploited": false}